    of active users does not exceed 10;
  - quote excerpts for non-profit teaching with attribution.

You may NOT, without prior written permission from AIEMY:
  - provide this software, or any derivative, as a product or service
    to third parties (SaaS, hosting, managed operations, paid support,
    client deliverables, outsourcing, bidding);
  - exceed the 10-active-user limit;
  - remove or alter any copyright notices;
  - sublicense or redistribute for any of the above purposes;
  - offer paid training or consulting under this project's name.

"Active users" means enabled accounts that can log in; disabled and
departed accounts are not counted. Trial and demo accounts are not
counted.

